# This repo (github.com/Muaddd1/VANTA-DETAIL) is a public SHOWCASE only — README.md +
# screenshots/. The real source stays local and ships as the Gumroad deliverable
# (VANTA-DETAIL-source.zip, whose README is README.template.md). Never commit source here.
# (src/index.css uses `source(none)` + explicit @source, so Tailwind still scans the ignored source.)
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/screenshots/
/screenshots/gumroad/
